Initial TLS certificates to be used for the new Silo’s console and API endpoints; should be valid for the Silo’s DNS name which follows the convention $SILO_NAME.sys.$OXIDE_DOMAIN_NAME or *.sys.$OXIDE_DOMAIN_NAME for a wildcard certificate:

    * name: A short name of the certificate

    * description: Certificate description (e.g., issuer, expiration date)

    * cert: PEM-formatted string containing public certificate chain

    * key: PEM-formatted string containing private key